<title>UK: Frankfurter Hypo sets 100 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Frankfurter Hypo sets 100 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following step-up bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FRANKFURTER HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     *4.375    MATURITY   *19.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.90    PAY DATE    19.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO FEBRUARY 1998, THEN STEPS UP TO 5.0 PCT IF NOT</p>
<p>		 CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>		 OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 711</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
